        'The parameters of this curve are not modifiable, so this function is\nstatic.\nDomain: [-1, 1]\nRange: [0, 1.794]\nNotes: It is upon the user to check that the muscle fiber is acting\n      within the specified domain. Force computations outside this range\n      may be incorrect.'
        ...

