class MatrixView(MatrixBaseDouble):
    "This class is identical to a Matrix_; it is used only to manage the C++ rules\nfor when copy constructors are called by introducing a separate type to\nprevent certain allowed optimizations from occuring when we don't want them.\nDespite the name, this may be an owner if a Matrix_ is recast to a MatrixView_.\nHowever, there are no owner constructors for MatrixView_."
    ...
    ...

