        ...

    def swap(self, *args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> Any:
        'This is a specialized algorithm providing constant time exchange of data\nwith another array that has identical element and index types. This is *much*\nfaster than using the std::swap() algorithm on the arrays since that would\ninvolve O(n) copying operations. This method makes no calls to any constructors\nor destructors. This is allowable even for non-owner arrays; the non-owner\nattribute will follow the non-owned data. *'
        ...

